{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_b8a5cb02e7a74616b47e4c7a7f9e3e78","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_18a7e7f62eecae052005e8ee7f6437bae63aca2c6beb93a38d4d6027c83440fd","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"h5i-dev/h5i@ec1a18cd4f2d snapshot 0b836cce6be3abbe","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_089aa3ee69e638a55437f29df42ad684ef592d4f36a18e77837362e683d5c527","slc_68b9d5cb23223ad40d355682652c58357849bc71d0f9d10b4389f31cebe569fe"],"source_ids":["src_113d32534a8d5bd295d4a96cbb95e77b"],"text":"Boxes are disposable environments holding code, agent, toolchain and optionally the browser session; box export produces a patch, report, receipt and timelines, and the agent has no direct host write path.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b8a5cb02e7a74616b47e4c7a7f9e3e78"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_b8a5cb02e7a74616b47e4c7a7f9e3e78","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1b0ca20ffdf79af0f570cfc76422ddf2c23e0b5f74647cd3983fd9de50ad20b7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"h5i-dev/h5i@ec1a18cd4f2d snapshot 0b836cce6be3abbe","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_63f664dae5971501c7d26cba4155b32c56a2274187fea5903cdb45370466b8e7","slc_eae6f9f97e638fa3967bd1f4119c308256623e70e9ec9b4a5dfd6263746e8aa7"],"source_ids":["src_113d32534a8d5bd295d4a96cbb95e77b"],"text":"Resident sessions in a box on Linux require a tier that keeps the engine alive; the supervised tier cannot hold a resident process because its seccomp-notify gate dies with the starting command.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b8a5cb02e7a74616b47e4c7a7f9e3e78"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_b8a5cb02e7a74616b47e4c7a7f9e3e78","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_38ba189317864945afe8c1d41cb03d4d03fa179bae3ce0d11de810b9b754496d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"h5i-dev/h5i@ec1a18cd4f2d snapshot 0b836cce6be3abbe","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_67bb2e2876343478d6228f50d25bfd4bb8ec2c2600b2a6ce702c4c5830f91561","slc_e9e67b03aec161b157f60c7e468ace90dc9c77d6cb67c38445726dc24db35884"],"source_ids":["src_113d32534a8d5bd295d4a96cbb95e77b"],"text":"A session grants only the origin it was opened on; --allow adds named origins, loopback is reachable by default unless --no-loopback, and off-origin subresources are refused and logged.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b8a5cb02e7a74616b47e4c7a7f9e3e78"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_b8a5cb02e7a74616b47e4c7a7f9e3e78","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3ab328624b2f95a74a76b5c6f16456314774aac88a2ede622f236c238d2f2cc6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"h5i-dev/h5i@ec1a18cd4f2d snapshot 0b836cce6be3abbe","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5234288b0ea2d24873328a443fd78ece3b1344bdfde0c0edf40b7d4f6ac13783","slc_9f9c145bbb88b27d36df23f7b6cad66773d612280c06ccf89249cb276156b82b","slc_d1cc0b203b91d82abcdf98e349b9893fbde1fe4c79596ac39acfaec36cfd2b45"],"source_ids":["src_113d32534a8d5bd295d4a96cbb95e77b"],"text":"By default a session runs unsandboxed on the host machine; --in places it in a box whose egress allowlist is enforced at a network boundary outside the engine.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b8a5cb02e7a74616b47e4c7a7f9e3e78"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_b8a5cb02e7a74616b47e4c7a7f9e3e78","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_45dd7056130d09882cca1838a55ae14d96c23f2d76aad537f1fab23caa36cba0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"h5i-dev/h5i@ec1a18cd4f2d snapshot 0b836cce6be3abbe","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b3d1d5e614ef3c72989970761bf0f001f0bf3d76766bc65b262a7e1c13ab6407"],"source_ids":["src_113d32534a8d5bd295d4a96cbb95e77b"],"text":"The manual states the browser is incomplete: Canvas, WebSockets, Workers and IndexedDB are absent, and of twenty SPAs measured, eighteen read usefully and one not at all.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b8a5cb02e7a74616b47e4c7a7f9e3e78"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_b8a5cb02e7a74616b47e4c7a7f9e3e78","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4a6b5bcd7d94345e631ed06921e78a771c7af6fa484985289b04469997fc6340","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"h5i-dev/h5i@ec1a18cd4f2d snapshot 0b836cce6be3abbe","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_cae121c3977de3cb8cc0ddf905113dfea715e44c5fc7f8d632a3541443ad298d"],"source_ids":["src_113d32534a8d5bd295d4a96cbb95e77b"],"text":"The manual's command table lists groups including browser, box, box share, ui, runner, skill, plugin, websec, recon, join, and shell completions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b8a5cb02e7a74616b47e4c7a7f9e3e78"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_b8a5cb02e7a74616b47e4c7a7f9e3e78","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_54d1a8c542f6fc1c53662bb895bfdc1d229de4e5a4068bcffb3f5b2a8b86eaf2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"h5i-dev/h5i@ec1a18cd4f2d snapshot 0b836cce6be3abbe","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_465b1ce7f06f344a9c52e1f1584b75ac694ea8491cc54cee8b457515a20d76bc","slc_e02b4d7874ca7c1ef300b700a97430f6b13ca6b65c4e10f11f1f93e6a311e10f","slc_fd12d1107a9eb9cbbb1bf1e98334d60620b0c5d78c0074d8c27a2eef2f6f57bd"],"source_ids":["src_113d32534a8d5bd295d4a96cbb95e77b","src_bc80a7762df55ceb850378ff6ec95a08"],"text":"Browser sessions are driven by verbs such as open, snapshot, click, type, extract, markdown, requests, audit, screenshot, reload, and close, with @ref handles identifying page elements.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b8a5cb02e7a74616b47e4c7a7f9e3e78"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_b8a5cb02e7a74616b47e4c7a7f9e3e78","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6d00511d06a0790e4de2617a462177f4d28cd89472f34b6e6c1092f4f66bc45c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"h5i-dev/h5i@ec1a18cd4f2d snapshot 0b836cce6be3abbe","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_455932f028b6a501e1f86b5d9f6054dfbcc7c5feffdba29a50891aa38653c4e5","slc_b84b8dd112e2f7b88b8caf5a6e611c0ea8beea98e81e3f5ef9299ceaa40afc5d"],"source_ids":["src_113d32534a8d5bd295d4a96cbb95e77b"],"text":"The engine is the HTTP client: every request is policy-checked and recorded before bytes move, and a fetch that cannot be recorded is refused, so the log is a decision record.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b8a5cb02e7a74616b47e4c7a7f9e3e78"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_b8a5cb02e7a74616b47e4c7a7f9e3e78","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_70494c6b379bdb0bd2eb145eeb4e30c2d4330a0c548f4f72b530f2eeb593eab0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"h5i-dev/h5i@ec1a18cd4f2d snapshot 0b836cce6be3abbe","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_32da8e818999398c9d0d103123b5bfc8f110f21adfda28b991adb1e43cda4264","slc_c4560b6dda2926cbcdccdae37ffc31689c42798b6c730a251217c801708ea93a"],"source_ids":["src_113d32534a8d5bd295d4a96cbb95e77b"],"text":"Verbs resolve a session via --session name or id, the H5I_BROWSER_SESSION variable, or the last-opened session; there is deliberately no single-live-session default.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b8a5cb02e7a74616b47e4c7a7f9e3e78"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_b8a5cb02e7a74616b47e4c7a7f9e3e78","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_874bc843f28ba695dcd5feb2c491b275a844395f747185bb0650c700608c102f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"h5i-dev/h5i@ec1a18cd4f2d snapshot 0b836cce6be3abbe","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_209aee9009f1514ca1ec6396398581c0b78c1664b28da558d03e3c47a4fc3be4","slc_f28b6d00d7fb373fc9b25c5f189c7ea7f8da9d5b063d1407e196f668084496db"],"source_ids":["src_113d32534a8d5bd295d4a96cbb95e77b"],"text":"Only the firefox-143-linux identity is currently supported; Chrome identities need client hints and WebGL capabilities the engine lacks, and identity consistency is explicitly not anonymity.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b8a5cb02e7a74616b47e4c7a7f9e3e78"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_b8a5cb02e7a74616b47e4c7a7f9e3e78","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8ce1c36a01b02366afdc324ae26bd0a02a9424c21a966f7670075322b204ee98","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"h5i-dev/h5i@ec1a18cd4f2d snapshot 0b836cce6be3abbe","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_31936cea9b240539ee74216949d301b7b97e38d32892e8d8e9367f8ca72958da","slc_3e8560b751ac7ba1e3dce674ced567aa5f5486d8058c11821399c6a00315ea67"],"source_ids":["src_113d32534a8d5bd295d4a96cbb95e77b"],"text":"h5i is one Rust binary with no server, daemon, or SaaS; websec and recon are optional plugins shipped as separate archives and registered via h5i plugin install.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b8a5cb02e7a74616b47e4c7a7f9e3e78"}
